msgstr "Stejná sazba DPH je v rekapitulaci účtenky dvakrát."

#. module: l10n_cssk_receipt_capture
#: model_terms:ir.ui.view,arch_db:l10n_cssk_receipt_capture.view_cssk_receipt_form
