msgstr "Tato účtenka nemá rekapitulaci DPH ani položky, není co zaúčtovat."

#. module: l10n_cssk_receipt_capture
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/l10n_cssk_receipt_capture/models/cssk_receipt.py:0
